	"data": "Skill Trees Physics Dependencies\n\nFull dependency graph completed for OpenStax College Physics (31 chapters). Six parallel tracks identified: Mechanics (Ch2-12), Thermodynamics (Ch13-15), Waves/Acoustics (Ch16-17), E&M (Ch18-23), Optics (Ch24-25), Modern Physics (Ch26-31). Key structural insights: Ch2 (Kinematics) is sole hard prerequisite; Ch4 (Newton's Laws) unlocks branching; Thermodynamics (Ch13) and Special Relativity (Ch26) accessible with only Ch2 prerequisite. Includes…",
